    <Event name="onClick" paragraph="BTN-DATA--ONCLICK"><![CDATA[       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       DATA DIVISION.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

           *> ENSURE-INIT: gives the page the desktop's start-up state when FUND-INIT failed.
           *> Uses:   WS-LOADED and INI-STATUS (nothing is done once the database answered, nor
           *>         without data); FLS-REQ, the filter of the last Apply (never the controls'
           *>         unapplied edits).
           *> Result: after a late Backend start: the header line, LST-N2 / LST-N3, the
           *>         dashboard, the Dados cards and the grid as the desktop shows them after
           *>         start-up; while the Backend is still down, its error in the header.

           CALL    "ENSURE-INIT"
           SET     WS-VIEW                       TO    "G"

           *> SHOW-VIEW: switches the page shown under the header: the dashboard (PG-DASH) or the
           *> Dados page.
           *> Uses:   WS-VIEW = "G" (the Dados page), set just above.
           *> Result: PG-DASH hidden and layer Dados shown; BTN-DATA gets BackgroundColor "#3E7BE8"
           *>         and ForegroundColor "#FFFFFF", BTN-DASH white with text "#1B2A4E"; on the
           *>         first visit (WS-GSTAGE = 0) STAGE-START-G also starts the Dados entrance.

           CALL    "SHOW-VIEW"
]]></Event>
