    <Event name="onClick" paragraph="BTN-PREV--ONCLICK"><![CDATA[       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       DATA DIVISION.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

           *> ENSURE-INIT: gives the page the desktop's start-up state when FUND-INIT failed.
           *> Uses:   WS-LOADED and INI-STATUS (nothing is done once the database answered, nor
           *>         without data); FLS-REQ, the filter of the last Apply (never the controls'
           *>         unapplied edits).
           *> Result: after a late Backend start: the header line, LST-N2 / LST-N3, the
           *>         dashboard, the Dados cards and the grid as the desktop shows them after
           *>         start-up; while the Backend is still down, its error in the header.

           CALL    "ENSURE-INIT"
           IF    WS-PAGE > 1
               SUBTRACT    1 FROM WS-PAGE

               *> REFRESH-GRID: reloads the grid page and its captions.
               *> Uses:   WS-PAGE, just reduced by 1 (it was above 1), CMB-ORDER::Value, and
               *>         FLS-REQ and WS-T-CNT as the last APPLY-FILTERS left them (the filters are
               *>         not re-run here).
               *> Result: GRD-FUNDOS holds the previous page; LBL-GRID-S, LBL-PAGE, BTN-PREV and
               *>         BTN-NEXT match that page (BTN-PREV is disabled on page 1).

               CALL    "REFRESH-GRID"
           END-IF
]]></Event>
    <Animation name="intro" trigger="Programmatic" kind="ZoomOut" duration="1800" delay="0" easing="Elastic" repeat="Once" slide-dx="0" slide-dy="0"/>
  </Control>
